WEBVTT

00:12.137 --> 00:16.016
THE CALAMITY

00:17.893 --> 00:20.395
<i>I've lived my way full of shame</i>

00:20.479 --> 00:24.857
<i>"Envy" comes from the ways
of the eventual end</i>

00:24.858 --> 00:27.319
<i>The ambiguous balance</i>

00:27.402 --> 00:30.239
<i>I want to cut ties at once</i>

00:31.531 --> 00:33.074
<i>It's too late to back down now</i>

00:33.075 --> 00:34.325
<i>Before this senile body dies</i>

00:34.326 --> 00:36.077
<i>My shadow will fade away soon, but</i>

00:36.078 --> 00:38.287
<i>Even if I disappear, my journey won't stop</i>

00:38.288 --> 00:39.789
<i>Uncertain days, certain endings</i>

00:39.790 --> 00:41.457
<i>My stories fill the in-betweens</i>

00:41.458 --> 00:44.210
<i>Beyond the wall blocking my way,
there is a calm morning</i>

00:44.211 --> 00:48.507
<i>Like the rising sun,
I stand with the wind at my back</i>

00:48.632 --> 00:52.677
<i>A burst of hope?</i>

00:52.678 --> 00:54.971
<i>Break through an endless night</i>

00:54.972 --> 00:59.893
<i>Show the sun waiting
at the end of darkness</i>

00:59.977 --> 01:03.020
<i>The promise is yet to be fulfilled</i>

01:03.021 --> 01:06.607
<i>but I stand in solitude not to let it go</i>

01:06.608 --> 01:09.485
<i>At the moment,
I'm connecting numerous lights</i>

01:09.486 --> 01:13.198
<i>to form a constellation
that paves tomorrow</i>

01:13.865 --> 01:17.743
<i>Even if the rain clouds
hide the night sky away</i>

01:17.744 --> 01:21.206
<i>there certainly is a flame in my heart</i>

01:21.540 --> 01:26.378
<i>God is no longer reliable</i>

01:26.545 --> 01:31.258
<i>I glance up towards the silver lining</i>

01:31.383 --> 01:37.597
<i>The destiny of bursting fate</i>

01:37.598 --> 01:39.933
BLEACH THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR

02:29.566 --> 02:30.400
What happened?

02:31.818 --> 02:33.195
Why are you so bewildered?

02:34.321 --> 02:35.364
Jushiro?

02:36.031 --> 02:38.200
Who else did you think it was?

02:38.742 --> 02:39.701
Right!

02:39.993 --> 02:41.078
Good point.

02:43.622 --> 02:46.416
So, you came to see me?

02:47.167 --> 02:49.795
Yhwach will probably
annihilate the Three Worlds.

02:50.587 --> 02:53.465
Using the power of
the Soul King's right arm,

02:53.590 --> 02:55.550
I was just barely able to prevent
the collapse...

02:56.051 --> 02:59.262
but that will end with my death.

02:59.846 --> 03:01.556
That's most likely
what will happen.

03:01.973 --> 03:05.560
That's why I want to bet
the last of my life on you...

03:06.478 --> 03:07.562
for the sake of this world.

03:08.271 --> 03:10.357
I appreciate the confidence,

03:10.482 --> 03:12.025
but is there a chance of winning?

03:12.359 --> 03:15.237
About the same chance of brazenly
going out on a date

03:15.362 --> 03:16.571
with Captain Unohana.

03:16.863 --> 03:19.408
So, it's entirely possible.

03:21.201 --> 03:22.077
You're right...

03:24.413 --> 03:25.580
Let's protect this world.

03:26.415 --> 03:28.583
I'll entrust my life to you.

03:29.167 --> 03:32.462
Damn it, that's just not my style.

03:32.671 --> 03:34.381
But you have no choice
but to do it, right?

03:34.965 --> 03:36.508
After all, you're now
Head Captain of

03:36.633 --> 03:39.052
the Thirteen Court Guard Squads.

03:40.470 --> 03:41.930
You've got me there.

03:42.597 --> 03:47.727
What's needed now is the strategy
and resolve to command...

03:49.479 --> 03:50.939
while honoring everyone's wishes...

03:53.066 --> 03:54.025
I know.

03:54.901 --> 03:58.363
You, more than anyone,
know what's most important.

04:05.162 --> 04:06.955
I'm going, Ukitake.

04:10.750 --> 04:12.294
I'm counting on you, Head Captain!

04:18.383 --> 04:19.217
Captain...

04:23.513 --> 04:25.474
Shall we get going, Nanao?

04:39.529 --> 04:40.697
This is as far as I can go.

04:42.491 --> 04:43.450
Kurosaki...

04:47.746 --> 04:49.247
I leave that in your hands!

05:13.230 --> 05:16.566
Multiple layers of energy swirling
in a vortex...

05:17.275 --> 05:19.736
It puts the distortion below
to shame.

05:20.570 --> 05:22.364
It's exactly as Master wrote.

05:23.114 --> 05:25.200
What is this room?

05:25.283 --> 05:26.409
Indeed!

05:26.910 --> 05:27.869
You guys!

05:28.245 --> 05:29.704
Oh! Uryu Ishida!

05:29.996 --> 05:31.581
Why are you here?

05:31.665 --> 05:33.250
Weren't you in
the World of the Living!

05:33.416 --> 05:34.459
Weren't you?!

05:34.751 --> 05:37.712
I should ask you—
what are you doing here?

05:38.004 --> 05:39.464
A lot happened.

05:39.589 --> 05:41.758
When I went outside
for a tiny look,

05:41.925 --> 05:43.885
I got caught up
in the black eyeballs...

05:43.969 --> 05:45.637
and before I knew it, I was here!

05:45.762 --> 05:47.806
And then, as I was wandering about...

05:47.931 --> 05:49.724
You ran into us, right?

05:51.601 --> 05:52.727
You're—!

05:54.020 --> 05:56.773
We were very successful at rescuing
Master Halibel, too!

05:56.982 --> 05:58.775
It was successful,
by the way!

05:59.276 --> 06:01.069
Tier Halibel, and...

06:01.570 --> 06:02.571
That mask...

06:02.779 --> 06:03.780
Is that you, Nel?

06:04.239 --> 06:06.199
This is the first time
I've met you in this form,

06:06.283 --> 06:07.200
isn't it, Uryu Ishida?

06:07.701 --> 06:08.577
Surprised?

06:09.619 --> 06:11.872
No, just a bit confused.

06:12.038 --> 06:13.248
Be honest!

06:13.373 --> 06:15.584
You were ogling Lady Nelliel,
weren't you?

06:15.959 --> 06:17.752
Stop making stuff up!

06:17.919 --> 06:18.920
Uryu Ishida...

06:19.880 --> 06:21.798
If you call yourself a Quincy,
then answer me.

06:22.549 --> 06:25.510
Who are you here for,
and what do you seek?

06:27.512 --> 06:28.471
Well, well...

06:28.930 --> 06:30.932
Sounds like we're having
a lot of fun.

06:32.309 --> 06:37.022
This looks like it's going to be
quite an unusual party.

06:58.877 --> 06:59.794
Gate closure complete!

07:00.170 --> 07:01.254
How's the border intensity?

07:01.796 --> 07:04.007
It's shrunk to minus 0.1.

07:04.174 --> 07:05.967
The expansion of the distortion
is slowing.

07:06.176 --> 07:08.511
All right...
That's perfect.

07:08.720 --> 07:10.722
We're getting multiple reports
from Rukon District

07:10.847 --> 07:13.224
of damage caused by Hollows!
What should we do?

07:13.808 --> 07:14.768
Nothing to be done.

07:15.143 --> 07:16.519
That's irresponsible!

07:16.770 --> 07:19.731
Our highest priority is to prevent
the collapse of the world.

07:20.231 --> 07:22.067
Our next step
is to rush the analysis

07:22.192 --> 07:23.485
of the Soul King's right arm.

07:24.027 --> 07:26.154
If we can continue even
after Captain Ukitake dies,

07:26.237 --> 07:27.489
then that's enough.

07:27.947 --> 07:29.240
"Even if he dies"?!

07:29.616 --> 07:31.701
It's for Captain Ukitake's sake.

07:32.160 --> 07:33.662
There's no "good" or "bad" here!

07:34.079 --> 07:36.164
We Soul Reapers ensure balance.

07:36.414 --> 07:37.332
Don't forget that.

07:38.208 --> 07:39.167
Yes, Sir.

07:39.668 --> 07:40.710
Understood.

07:41.211 --> 07:45.173
Abandoning Rukon District will be
a means to save Seireitei.

07:45.882 --> 07:48.385
Maybe Rukon District existed
just for this moment.

07:53.390 --> 07:54.349
Arrancar?!

07:56.101 --> 07:57.769
Don't panic... don't panic...

07:58.228 --> 07:59.646
I told you, it's a party.

08:00.313 --> 08:02.023
It's been quite a while, hasn't it?

08:02.732 --> 08:06.528
I never thought
I'd see your face again.

08:07.153 --> 08:09.364
You took the words right
out of my mouth, Soul Reaper.

08:09.447 --> 08:10.280
I must say,

08:10.281 --> 08:12.450
this is an ominous monstrosity
you've got here.

08:12.784 --> 08:13.952
What is this thing?

08:14.661 --> 08:19.207
A vortex that will victimize
this entire world, shall we say?

08:19.874 --> 08:21.209
I see.

08:21.751 --> 08:23.503
So then,
this is where the distortion

08:23.586 --> 08:25.463
that appeared in
the Three Worlds started.

08:26.047 --> 08:27.674
Would I be correct in assuming

08:27.757 --> 08:31.553
this was the final objective
of you Quincies, Uryu?

08:32.178 --> 08:33.221
Exactly.

08:33.888 --> 08:37.350
A single arrow set up by Yhwach
before this war even began...

08:37.642 --> 08:39.561
designed to trigger
the collapse of the world.

08:40.311 --> 08:45.817
And destroying this distortion
is my duty as the last Quincy.

08:47.527 --> 08:50.572
<i>A part of the burden fell onto me...</i>

08:51.781 --> 08:54.492
<i>In my hope for a world
where Quincies are accepted...</i>

08:54.951 --> 08:56.369
<i>and a yearning for absolute power,</i>

08:56.453 --> 08:58.663
<i>I reached the end of my research...</i>

08:59.539 --> 09:02.083
<i>A power that fuses souls
of different species...</i>

09:02.417 --> 09:05.628
<i>and creates souls of
a much higher level</i>

09:05.754 --> 09:07.756
<i>by disrupting their balance.</i>

09:08.590 --> 09:11.217
<i>Unfortunately, I was unable
to control that power...</i>

09:11.468 --> 09:13.678
<i>and invited the collapse
of the Three Worlds.</i>

09:14.637 --> 09:15.805
<i>Then, I realized...</i>

09:16.306 --> 09:18.058
<i>This seed of destruction
was exactly</i>

09:18.141 --> 09:21.269
<i>what the Quincy King
had desired all along.</i>

09:22.270 --> 09:24.731
<i>Once the seed of destruction
is unleashed,</i>

09:24.814 --> 09:26.232
<i>nothing can be done to stop it.</i>

09:27.067 --> 09:29.277
<i>If there is a sliver
of a possibility,</i>

09:29.402 --> 09:31.154
<i>it would be to bring
the seed of destruction</i>

09:31.237 --> 09:33.697
<i>and the center of the distortion
at the boundary of the worlds</i>

09:33.698 --> 09:35.033
<i>into a direct collision,</i>

09:35.158 --> 09:37.660
<i>possibly triggering
mutual annihilation.</i>

09:38.328 --> 09:41.831
<i>The problem is that the energy
unleashed by that annihilation</i>

09:41.998 --> 09:43.917
<i>will be unimaginable.</i>

09:44.584 --> 09:47.670
<i>Even so, as one
who lives in this world,</i>

09:47.962 --> 09:50.131
<i>someone needs to do it...</i>

09:52.926 --> 09:53.843
I see...

09:54.511 --> 09:57.013
So if the seed of destruction...

09:57.430 --> 09:59.723
and the distortion spreading
below collide,

09:59.724 --> 10:01.601
we can make them both disappear?

10:02.352 --> 10:05.188
And Yhwach's plans along with it,
is that it?

10:05.396 --> 10:06.773
It can't be that simple!

10:07.023 --> 10:08.441
It's very simple.

10:08.942 --> 10:11.820
If we can do that,
we can save the world, right?

10:12.112 --> 10:13.404
I understand what you're saying.

10:13.780 --> 10:14.739
But how do we do it?

10:15.156 --> 10:16.825
Have you thought
this through carefully?

10:16.991 --> 10:18.785
Well, Uryu Ishida?!

10:19.077 --> 10:20.537
We can make them collide.

10:20.703 --> 10:21.579
What?!

10:21.955 --> 10:23.665
You intend to have
the castle fall with it?

10:25.708 --> 10:27.919
But how do we drop something
with that much mass?

10:28.044 --> 10:30.213
It's comprised of reishi.

10:30.547 --> 10:31.506
I'll make it happen.

10:31.756 --> 10:33.508
Can you do that alone?

10:35.301 --> 10:37.887
I'm saying
the destruction of the world

10:38.012 --> 10:39.180
isn't your problem alone.

10:39.597 --> 10:41.266
Get to the point, Halibel!

10:41.850 --> 10:43.852
She's saying you're not alone...

10:44.227 --> 10:46.604
and that we're here to help.

10:47.105 --> 10:49.023
You, Arrancar?

10:49.399 --> 10:51.151
You're friends with Ichigo, right?

10:51.401 --> 10:53.403
It's not as simple as letting
the castle fall.

10:53.820 --> 10:54.696
In a worst case,

10:54.821 --> 10:57.448
there's a possibly of fighting
directly with Yhwach.

10:58.032 --> 11:00.660
I'm the only one who can compete
with his power.

11:00.785 --> 11:02.162
Then all the more reason.

11:02.829 --> 11:05.874
You should use that power
to help Ichigo.

11:07.417 --> 11:09.210
I can't guarantee
you'll make it out alive.

11:09.669 --> 11:12.172
I never asked for that.

11:13.089 --> 11:15.175
You shouldn't say that
to an Arrancar.

11:16.676 --> 11:17.552
Understood.

11:18.094 --> 11:21.097
Then I'll use your powers
without reservation.

11:21.806 --> 11:24.809
We'll lend a hand, too, of course.

11:25.185 --> 11:26.935
Man, who'd have thought
a day would come when

11:26.936 --> 11:29.605
Soul Reapers, Quincies, and Hollows
would fight together

11:29.606 --> 11:30.982
to save the world.

11:31.399 --> 11:33.902
You've grown up, Uryu Ishida!

11:33.985 --> 11:35.820
I'm happy, by the way!

11:36.070 --> 11:37.405
Wait, hold on!

11:37.614 --> 11:38.573
Let the castle fall?

11:38.656 --> 11:40.742
What about the people
at the Royal Palace right now?

11:41.117 --> 11:43.703
We're only letting
this central tower fall.

11:45.455 --> 11:46.289
What are those?

11:47.123 --> 11:49.125
These were built using Quincy
secret technology.

11:49.417 --> 11:52.253
They can break down
and scatter reishi...

11:52.545 --> 11:53.755
Leiden Scherben.

11:54.422 --> 11:56.299
Simply put... explosives.

11:57.467 --> 12:01.054
We'll blast the five bridges
extending from this central tower...

12:01.304 --> 12:03.014
and separate it from
the detached palace.

12:03.181 --> 12:05.600
That was your plan from
the beginning?

12:06.017 --> 12:06.935
It was.

12:07.060 --> 12:09.062
I have no intention of causing
unnecessary damage.

12:09.562 --> 12:12.482
We have to make this work,
no matter what.

12:17.070 --> 12:17.946
We've got this.

12:22.992 --> 12:24.661
Our mission right now...

12:25.245 --> 12:27.288
is to protect this world.

12:28.081 --> 12:30.959
I understand your concerns, Nanao,
but we'll be fine.

12:31.626 --> 12:33.002
We won't "work it out."

12:33.253 --> 12:34.629
We'll "make it work."

12:36.464 --> 12:37.382
Captain?

12:37.590 --> 12:38.466
I'll leave it to you.

12:38.925 --> 12:41.135
I've got something else
to do, okay?

12:43.763 --> 12:44.639
I understand.

12:48.851 --> 12:49.727
All right!

12:50.561 --> 12:51.688
Let's draw our bows.

13:00.029 --> 13:02.740
Have you given up already, Ichigo?

13:07.787 --> 13:09.789
That isn't like you.

13:12.834 --> 13:14.669
<i>My sword's ineffective...</i>

13:15.753 --> 13:17.088
<i>Inoue's power...</i>

13:17.755 --> 13:19.966
<i>and everyone's powers
have no effect.</i>

13:26.931 --> 13:27.849
<i>It's over.</i>

13:29.183 --> 13:30.476
So that's it?

13:30.643 --> 13:31.728
How boring...

13:31.936 --> 13:32.812
No...

13:32.937 --> 13:35.606
Perhaps I should say it was fun.

13:36.566 --> 13:40.278
Now then,
this is your final mission.

13:42.989 --> 13:45.700
The power I gave you...

13:45.908 --> 13:47.702
I'm taking it back.

14:07.555 --> 14:09.223
What is... that?

14:14.103 --> 14:15.063
That's...

14:15.313 --> 14:17.148
W-What the hell?!

14:17.607 --> 14:19.525
Is something else about to happen?

14:19.984 --> 14:20.860
It's as though...

14:21.360 --> 14:23.237
...it's the end of the world.

14:28.618 --> 14:29.660
Kurosaki!

14:29.952 --> 14:33.206
It's time to say farewell,
Ichigo Kurosaki...

14:34.290 --> 14:37.585
A Soul Reaper consumed by despair.

15:05.696 --> 15:07.365
WARNING

15:07.406 --> 15:08.825
- Captain Ukitake!
- Captain Ukitake!

15:24.674 --> 15:26.634
Are you seeing this, Ukitake?

15:28.302 --> 15:30.388
Okay.
It's time for the final fight.

15:32.640 --> 15:33.558
<i>Oh...</i>

15:33.850 --> 15:34.725
<i>It's going away...</i>

15:35.977 --> 15:38.646
<i>The Quincy power inside me...</i>

15:39.605 --> 15:42.775
<i>The Hollow power that
was mixed with it...</i>

15:43.776 --> 15:44.735
<i>It's disappearing...</i>

15:45.987 --> 15:46.946
<i>Disappearing...</i>

15:48.239 --> 15:49.323
<i>Into white...</i>

16:07.884 --> 16:10.845
To the old world
of never-ending chaos...

16:12.972 --> 16:15.099
The seed blooms...

16:16.893 --> 16:20.605
Become an offering to
chaotic tranquility.

16:42.335 --> 16:43.961
What's the matter, Uryu?

16:44.253 --> 16:47.048
Is this the future you said
you would show me?

16:47.381 --> 16:48.341
It is.

16:49.634 --> 16:54.055
Guess you're not going to ask
what happened to Ichigo.

16:54.430 --> 16:55.848
Because I don't need to.

16:56.641 --> 17:00.603
It appears you haven't been able
to see my feelings all along.

17:12.114 --> 17:13.950
Consider the debt settled.

17:14.450 --> 17:17.078
In fact, now you owe me,
Ichigo Kurosaki!

17:17.411 --> 17:18.579
That's right, by the way!

17:25.795 --> 17:28.839
What's the point in
seeing your feelings?

17:40.101 --> 17:40.977
Super Acceleration.

17:58.244 --> 18:00.871
Have you forgotten the rift so vast

18:00.997 --> 18:04.959
that even "despair" felt lukewarm,
King of the Arrancar?

18:05.251 --> 18:07.169
I told you, I'm not a king.

18:08.504 --> 18:09.463
Cascada.

18:18.806 --> 18:20.933
Playtime is over.

18:21.517 --> 18:22.560
Sorry...

18:23.185 --> 18:24.812
I want to play a little more.

18:27.857 --> 18:30.109
It's a variant application of
Feder Zwinger.

18:31.569 --> 18:35.113
It breaks down
the massive volume of reishi

18:35.114 --> 18:36.949
here in Wahr Welt...

18:37.450 --> 18:38.534
before reabsorbing it.

18:40.369 --> 18:43.497
This is an arrow
you probably can't ignore.

18:43.706 --> 18:46.167
Lanzador Verde!

18:46.626 --> 18:47.501
It's over.

18:50.046 --> 18:53.132
Is that the "hope" you choose?

18:53.507 --> 18:55.009
I haven't chosen yet!

19:06.354 --> 19:07.355
What foolishness.

19:07.605 --> 19:11.859
Everything is meaningless before my
The Almighty.

19:12.276 --> 19:16.447
I've already broken the other arrow
of hope that you shot.

19:19.909 --> 19:22.828
I knew you would
choose that future.

19:24.163 --> 19:25.206
That is why I...

19:25.456 --> 19:27.583
swapped it for a future
where it never broke.

19:36.217 --> 19:39.887
You did well to refine my power
to such an extent.

19:40.388 --> 19:42.348
However, the explosive scattering
of energy

19:42.431 --> 19:44.767
born from the collision of the seed
and the distortion...

19:45.017 --> 19:46.810
will swallow not only
the Royal Palace,

19:46.811 --> 19:49.146
but the Seireitei along with it.

19:49.605 --> 19:51.065
I'm aware of that.

19:51.440 --> 19:55.486
That's why this is a victory
I could not achieve alone.

20:00.825 --> 20:02.618
Please!
Oh, please!

20:04.870 --> 20:05.913
Antithesis.

21:37.630 --> 21:38.464
With this...

21:38.964 --> 21:41.842
...the war has finally ended, huh?

21:53.771 --> 21:55.064
Uryu...

21:55.189 --> 21:58.108
I have taken full measure
of your power...

21:58.651 --> 22:02.738
However... it alters nothing
of the future I forged.

22:04.323 --> 22:09.745
Every last Schrift has been
sublimated into The Almighty.

22:10.412 --> 22:12.998
These nine days of the world's end...

22:13.082 --> 22:15.459
On this circular path,

22:15.584 --> 22:19.588
they are both the end and beginning
of the Welt.

22:24.885 --> 22:27.555
I see all.

22:33.519 --> 22:34.811
<i>Retracing memories</i>

22:34.812 --> 22:38.440
<i>An unexpected gaze</i>

22:38.524 --> 22:41.067
<i>The world I didn't want</i>

22:41.068 --> 22:42.986
<i>I've started breaking it down</i>

22:42.987 --> 22:45.697
<i>Lean on each other and face forward</i>

22:45.698 --> 22:48.284
<i>I want to change my fate</i>

22:48.409 --> 22:51.495
<i>All the voices shout</i>

22:51.579 --> 22:53.664
<i>The sound rang out</i>

23:09.096 --> 23:11.639
<i>I saw countless scattered shadows</i>

23:11.640 --> 23:13.976
<i>and I laughed</i>

23:14.143 --> 23:16.436
<i>A world that's lost its color</i>

23:16.437 --> 23:18.731
<i>I'll illuminate it again</i>

23:18.814 --> 23:21.400
<i>Broken and lamenting</i>

23:21.483 --> 23:24.028
<i>The end of the dream</i>

23:24.111 --> 23:28.615
<i>Shaking free from it over and over again
with a still-connected heart</i>

23:28.616 --> 23:34.287
<i>I'll protect today,
the path I've walked all this time</i>

23:34.288 --> 23:35.331
<i>Break it</i>

23:35.456 --> 23:37.957
<i>Tear the future apart, call my name</i>

23:37.958 --> 23:40.960
<i>Turn your back on your predetermined past</i>

23:40.961 --> 23:43.838
<i>Today keeps playing with fate</i>

23:43.839 --> 23:45.799
<i>Reclaim it here and now</i>

23:45.883 --> 23:48.509
<i>To the ends of the earth, an unseen dream</i>

23:48.510 --> 23:51.221
<i>With eyes that know the strength
that lies in words</i>

23:51.305 --> 23:54.349
<i>Notice the distorted spiral</i>

23:54.350 --> 23:57.894
<i>My fate has been set in motion</i>

23:57.895 --> 24:01.982
BLEACH: THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR

24:07.029 --> 24:10.115
<i>People are all
imitations of monkeys...</i>

24:11.325 --> 24:14.453
<i>Gods are all
imitations of people...</i>
